<view class="page">
  <view class="card block">
    <view class="label">反馈内容</view>
    <textarea class="area" placeholder="说说遇到的问题、想要的功能或任何建议…" placeholder-class="ph"
      value="{{text}}" bindinput="onText" maxlength="500" auto-height></textarea>

    <view class="label">联系方式（选填）</view>
    <input class="input" placeholder="微信 / 邮箱 / 手机号" placeholder-class="ph"
      value="{{contact}}" bindinput="onContact" maxlength="60" />
  </view>

  <view class="card email-card row">
    <view class="fill">
      <view class="muted small">接收反馈邮箱</view>
      <view class="email">{{email}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="copy" bindtap="copyEmail">复制邮箱</view>
  </view>

  <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block submit" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="submit">
    {{submitting ? '处理中…' : '提交反馈'}}
  </button>

  <view class="tip muted small">
    当前版本会把反馈保存到本机并复制完整内容，你发送邮件到上方邮箱即可；接入云开发云函数后，可实现自动发送到后台邮箱。
  </view>
</view>
